      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MORAINE PIPER (5) settled down midfield and held her position to the line when finishing 4th (31.15) at The Meadows. Has ability and looks hard to stop. DR. AXEL (1) drifted back from the inside but sliced through to hit the frame when a 1.3 lengths second (24.77) at this track in Grade 5. Must be included in calculations. NO EXIT (6) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing seventh (25.05) last time in a Grade 5 at this track. Has a very good strike-rate from this draw, with two wins from four starts. Will give the top chances plenty to think about. DR. LOUIS (4) is a last start winner and can go on with it.",
